      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B00.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 4.27
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "recap",
      "narration_text": "Last week, I separated conclusion confidence from evidence reliability. This week, I looked at how uncertainty moves through an entire assessment.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B01_Recap",
        "visual_intent": "Five-week timeline.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.71
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "literature review",
      "narration_text": "My fifth paper is Towards a Comprehensive Uncertainty Assessment in Environmental Research and Decision Support, by Peter Reichert, published in Water Science and Technology in twenty twenty.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B02_Paper",
        "visual_intent": "Citation card for paper 5.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 12.31
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "the problem",
      "narration_text": "The author argues that uncertainty quantification is essential for environmental management, yet many assessments don't account for all the uncertainties involved.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B03_Missing",
        "visual_intent": "Only some uncertainties get counted.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.41
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "the problem",
      "narration_text": "And even when uncertainty is quantified, researchers may not check how sensitive the results are to the assumptions behind that quantification.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B04_Sensitivity",
        "visual_intent": "An assumption slider changes the band.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.3
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "approach 1",
      "narration_text": "The paper discusses several ways to improve. First, stochastic, mechanistic models, which let uncertainty propagate from its original sources, through the model, to the final results.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B05_Propagate",
        "visual_intent": "Uncertainty flows source → model → result.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 12.37
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "approach 2",
      "narration_text": "Second, data science methods that explore datasets, identify relationships, and benchmark environmental models.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B06_DataScience",
        "visual_intent": "Explore · relate · benchmark.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B06.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 7.66
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "approach 3",
      "narration_text": "Third, examining alternative model structures, rather than relying on a single model to represent a complex environmental system.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B07_Structures",
        "visual_intent": "Several model structures, not one.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B07.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.47
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "beyond science",
      "narration_text": "It also looks at uncertainty beyond scientific predictions. Environmental decisions depend on societal preferences, stakeholder priorities, and judgments about acceptable outcomes.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B08_Values",
        "visual_intent": "Values feed the decision.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B08.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 12.63
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "beyond science",
      "narration_text": "Those preferences can be uncertain too, and different stakeholders may interpret environmental trade-offs differently.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B09_Tradeoffs",
        "visual_intent": "Stakeholders weigh trade-offs differently.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B09.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 6.72
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "whole process",
      "narration_text": "So uncertainty can affect the whole decision support process: from the initial data and models, to the interpretation of results, and the final decision.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B10_Process",
        "visual_intent": "Uncertainty along the whole chain.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B10.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.6
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B11",
      "act": "insight",
      "narration_text": "For my research, the key concept is that uncertainty can accumulate and propagate through an assessment. Imagine an A I analyzing a company's carbon emissions.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B11_Carbon",
        "visual_intent": "Set up the carbon example.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B11.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.47
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B12",
      "act": "example",
      "narration_text": "The activity data are incomplete. The emissions factors are estimated. The calculation method has limitations. Then the A I interprets the results, and produces a final conclusion about environmental performance.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B12_Stack",
        "visual_intent": "Uncertainty accumulates stage by stage.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B12.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 14.21
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B13",
      "act": "example",
      "narration_text": "Uncertainty at each stage can influence the final conclusion. Simply attaching a confidence score to the final answer may hide where that uncertainty came from.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B13_Collapse",
        "visual_intent": "One score hides the origins.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B13.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.11
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B14",
      "act": "insight",
      "narration_text": "So my research could explore whether A I should communicate uncertainty at each stage of its analysis, rather than only attaching a confidence score to its final answer.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B14_Staged",
        "visual_intent": "Uncertainty reported per stage.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B14.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.24
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "BHTF",
      "act": "your turn",
      "narration_text": "Your turn. When an A I gives you a final answer, ask: where along the way did the uncertainty come from?",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
